                        



Item #:  SCP-5167

Object Class:  Euclid

Special Containment Features:  An area of 10^2 kilometers are to be cordoned off by means of a concrete wall approximately 5 meters tall and 5 meters deep. An underground concrete shell is to buffer the temporary dimension form ours and prevent contamination as well as escape of SCP-5167-3 instances (see entity report 5167-2).

Any unauthorized civilians found on the premises are to be detained, questioned and quarantined for at least one month during which they will be tested for any contaminants. If released they are to be given appropriate amnestics and released with a cover story to regarding their absence. Any personnel assigned to or transfered from the site must undergo a month of quarantine and testing for contaminants before entering or leaving the site.

Underground sensors and live feed cameras are to be placed along perimeter wall and patrolled by at least 10 groups of 2 agents. SCP-5167-3 is the identification given to any entity from another dimension which has breached containment (see Entity Report). Any reports of SCP-5167-3’s are to be tracked down and exterminated immediately. No wildlife or objects originating from the zone are to be allowed to leave the exclusion zone (see Entity Report 5167-2). Agents are not to come into contact with any creatures or objects from the zone and any terminated wildlife is to be immediately reported and appropriate quarantine measures and study are to be enacted.

If SCP-5167-2 changes the zones current dimension, the site is to immediately put on lockdown and all nearby foundation military assets are to be put on standby. Atmospheric sensors are to be immediately activated and bioaerosols test are to be immediately conducted (see Exploration Report Document: Dimension 5). The sites SRA is to be immediately prepped and prepared for possible use as well as the backup device. Once all appropriate observational tests have been conducted, an MTF team is to be cleared to perform a reconnaissance mission within the entire zone. Once this and all tests have been conducted and all potential threats dealt with or at least accounted for, the site may return to its normal function.

Description:  SCP-5167 is the designation given to both an anomalous site (SCP-5167-1) and the entity that affects it (SCP-5167-2). SCP-5167-1 is a laboratory built within an fortress dated to the early 1700's near the town of ███████ in the Black Forest, Germany. Within the lab located in what is believe to be the site command center is an anomalous organism/machine designated SCP-5167-2. SCP-5167-2 is approximately 3 meters tall and 3.5 meters wide, composed of both mechanical structures resembling a Z3 computer covered in flesh. The flesh's origins are unknown as its DNA matches no known creature. It is covered in dozens of eyes and lumps of tumorous growths with tendrils extending from both between the mechanical construct and the building itself.

SCP-5167-2 is capable of shifting a specific 1^2 kilometer area located just outside the building from our dimension to that of another. It is currently unknown how the entity is capable of such actions or to what degree of effect both the machine and organic parts of the entity have on the process nor how to control it. The area affected by SCP-5167-2 is enclosed by a energy fence using Tesla coils to arc electricity between pylons located approximately 10 meters away from the area’s “reality wall”. The Reality Wall is an invisible barrier that separates the connected dimension to our dimension and acts as a one-way door. Objects that pass from our dimension past the perimeter will find themselves in the other dimension with no sign of our dimension. Returning from the same direction you came will not enable you to leave and you will only continue to travel in the other dimension even if you can even be observed from the outside though only as long as you stay within the 1 kilometer area. Standard communication devices placed within the perimeter can receive information from our side but cannot send info back to our side. Objects from another dimension that pass into ours cannot pass through the perimeter back into their original dimension either. Instead when they attempt to recross the perimeter they seem unable to interact with what appears in the other dimension and appear to interact with the area from our dimension in that space despite us not being able to see it. However, of the few human controlled functions of SCP-5167-2, one is the ability to allow exit and entry of the zone despite one side you are on. Essentially when powered on, subjects within the zone will be able to see our dimension again and return to it. The downside of this function is that it apparently requires a massive amount of energy in order to manipulate reality putting severe strain on the organic half of SCP-5167-2. As such the function is only to be left on for 30 minutes at maximum before a forced shutdown of the function. The maximum time limit is to be set at 15 minutes due to the age and degradation of the organism in SCP-5167-2. It is expected that unless we can “repair” the organism, assuming that is an option, this number will be lowered. It is quite possible that it may become unable to complete that function or even worse all functions in general leaving the machine possibly inert and useless. Actions are underway to prevent this and possibly restore the organism and we are searching for alternative options of opening the gate through the use of SRA technology.

Addendum:  The Foundation was first notified of a possible anomaly on 21/9/1947 when locals reported “monsters” attacking cattle and livestock. MTF units were sent to investigate and while successfully captured or killed multiple instances were unable to initially locate the source. Finally, on 03/11/1947 an MTF unit discovered a previously unreported military installation. After a short reconnoiter it was confirmed to be the origin of the creatures. Foundation assets initially had difficulty in confirming location of installation even by reconnaissance aircraft. Thaumatological symbols and implements were soon discovered at site designed to make the location hard to find until they were removed.

It appears to have been abandoned in 1944 or 1945 due to the dissolving of the Ahnenerbe Obskurakorps or the invasion of Germany. Few records remain onsite after being abandoned due to purposeful destruction of information. Of the few remaining records, several indicate that the site was the central site of an Obskurakorps project known as Project Ragnarök.

